{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026CFo0Btvq0N1793328306.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《美食新聞報道》首站由中韓混血兒 Aki 帶著伍倩彤（Gillian）前往北角一間專營正宗韓國料理的特色餐廳。<br/></p><p>第一站來到北角，由中韓混血兒Aki帶領伍倩彤（Gillian）前往一間專營正宗韓國料理的特色餐廳「民迎」：</p><p></p><ul><li><p>韓式刺身套餐：展現最道地的韓式海鮮吃法。韓國在地「至正宗」食法為先以新鮮生菜包覆厚切刺身，再放上生蒜片與酸辣泡菜一同入口。生菜的爽脆與蒜香泡菜的辛辣完美襯托出魚肉的鮮甜，口感層次極其豐富。</p></li><li><p>辣魚卵湯與蟹膏粥：辣魚卵湯巧妙運用韓國刺身剩下的魚骨慢火熬煮成濃郁辣湯，冷熱交替間不但能瞬間去腥解膩，更能暖胃滋味；蟹膏粥則濃郁綿密，每一口都充滿甘香的蟹膏精華。</p></li><li><p>新鮮活長腳章魚他他：喜歡挑戰新鮮視覺與口感的食客絕不能錯過。店家選用現宰鮮活長腳章魚，切段後章魚觸手神經依然高度活躍並於盤中蠕動，展現極致新鮮最高品質，入口口感Q彈、嚼勁十足。但特別提醒：進食活海鮮具一定窒息風險，請食客務必慢慢細嚼後再吞嚥。</p></li><li><p>韓式醬油醃花蟹：被譽為韓國經典「白飯小偷」。花蟹吸盡秘製醬汁精華，蟹膏豐富、蟹肉鮮甜綿密，拌飯享用令人停不下來。</p></li></ul><p>民迎</p><p>地址：北角電氣道233號城市花園第1座地下B號舖</p><p><p><img alt=\"7946805b-f694-49e0-a003-170d17f30f1b.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/202627ym7XeEiJ1793328308.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"a7244380-2836-4549-be39-8ef99070073e.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026hqs5XDGtOz1793328307.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8089ddc8-4893-4990-b89a-6d6fa6fc23ff.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026rgUeTKXpYv1793328307.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d131163a-a094-4031-a708-63e6a778ee71.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Ok1l1BYcgF1793328307.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"776be57e-0062-4789-9eab-0e16169471e1.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026bM4rxBrufF1793328308.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p>第二站由黃嘉雯與蔡景行（行仔）來到寸金尺土的中環，開箱位於萬邦行的平民奢華「點心午餐放題」餐廳「霞飛飛」：</p><ul><li><p>平民奢華點心午餐放題：每位只需$218即可任食多款精緻點心與招牌佳餚！</p></li><li><p>豐富菜色包括：片皮鴨、香濃咖喱灌湯小籠包、川味麻辣灌湯小籠包、灌湯生煎包、柚皮扣鵝掌、鎮江水晶肴肉、夫妻肺片、招牌擔擔麵以及豆沙鍋餅，每一道都非常足料，性價比極高！</p><p></p></li></ul><p>霞飛飛<br/>地址：中環皇后大道中33號萬邦行2樓211號舖</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"55ecc078-16e3-4bfc-9f5c-c8cb86977cc3.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026gHlJadRBl71793328309.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"58e58a5e-8036-46ff-a7bf-5c2fce6b2d66.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Qj0BPf9Rr51793328309.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"66d9f290-7b54-4765-b62b-1ec40f8bbeef.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026VvGdrSiziH1793328309.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"19823be3-7f61-4e8c-a4ce-e47fd4679dec.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20261fOnT4gzHH1793328309.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9909c52c-81c2-49cf-b1b7-aaf2306d7168.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Ff3AudygDC1793328310.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3d2785e4-8e71-43d9-b503-b26055d1a20f.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026JunzGmsaGY1793328311.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4cf8b220-a520-4896-bd26-111fa94b2b71.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026LWpWiy8oO21793328310.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:16.974460+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":694,"images":13,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T13:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:14.075774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:48.804525+00:00","content_hash":"6bf78c9606b4ac385e21fd830015a54c18b07313efbc2d0ad2a2c27ab29ba233","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}